==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|colere||bile, anger}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|cholera||bilious disease}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|χολή||bile}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|kō'lər}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# [[anger|Anger]] or [[irritability]].
# One of the [[w:four humours|four humours]] of ancient physiology, also known as [[yellow bile]].

